{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"希伯来书","commonName":"希伯来书","title":"希伯来书","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"88dfe968124b22760b2021a1ff05966bca10f085ce6d6eeba0253dacf63dd9ff","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":301},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["划时代的启示"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["在古代，上帝曾借着先知多次多方向我们的祖先说话，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["在这世界的末期，祂又借着自己的儿子向我们说话。上帝早已立祂承受万物，并借着祂创造了宇宙万物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["祂是上帝荣耀的光辉，是上帝本体的真像。祂用自己充满能力的话语维系万物。祂洗净了世人的罪之后，便坐在天上至高上帝的右边。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["祂既承受了比天使更高的名，就远超越天使。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["上帝从未对任何一个天使说：",{"text":"“你是我的儿子，我今日成为你父亲。”","poem":1},{"noteId":0},"或说：",{"text":"“我要做祂的父亲，祂要做我的儿子。”","poem":1},{"noteId":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["上帝差遣祂的长子到世上来时，却说：",{"text":"“上帝的天使都要敬拜祂。”","poem":1},{"noteId":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["上帝提到天使的时候，只是说：",{"text":"“祂以风为使者，以火焰为仆役。”","poem":1},{"noteId":3}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["关于这儿子，祂却说：",{"text":"“上帝啊，你的宝座永远长存，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你以公义的杖执掌王权。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你喜爱公义，憎恶邪恶。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以上帝，你的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用喜乐之油膏你，使你超过同伴。”","poem":1},{"noteId":4}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["此外又说：",{"text":"“主啊，太初你奠立大地的根基，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亲手创造诸天。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天地都要消亡，但你永远长存。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天地都会像外衣渐渐破旧，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要把天地像外衣一样卷起来。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天地将如衣服一样被更换，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你永远不变，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的年日永无穷尽。”","poem":1},{"noteId":5}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["上帝从未对任何一个天使说：",{"text":"“你坐在我的右边，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等我使你的仇敌成为你的脚凳。”","poem":1},{"noteId":6}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["天使岂不都是服侍的灵，奉差遣为那些将要承受救恩的人服务吗？"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇2:7。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":5}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"撒母耳记下7:14；历代志上17:13。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":5}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"申命记32:43。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":6}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇104:4。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":7}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇45:6、7。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":9}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇102:25‑27。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":12}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇110:1。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PHM/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}